{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-remember",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 1300,
  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "remember",
  "ipa": [
    "rɪˈmembə(r)"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "starLevel": 3,
  "levelMark": true,
  "textbook": [
    "G6上U5"
  ],
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "记得；想起"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The famous singer died, but her sweet voice will "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be remembered"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " for ever."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这位著名歌手去世了，但她甜美的声音将永远被铭记。"
    }
  ],
  "antonyms": [
    "forget"
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "remember 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其习惯用法，及比较 remember doing 与 remember to do 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) remember doing 表示记得做过某事（已做）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) remember to do 表示记住去做某件事（还没做）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "remembered turning off"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the lights when I left the room."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我记得我离开房间时把灯关了。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Please "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "remember to close"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the door when you go to bed."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "你去睡觉时，请记住把门关上。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
